===Etymology===
{{root|ru|ine-pro|*lewbʰ-|id=love}}
{{inh+|ru|sla-pro|*ľubiti}}, from {{der|ru|ine-pro|*lewbʰ-}}, whence {{cog|en|love}}, {{cog|sa|लुभ्यति||to desire}}, {{cog|sa|लोभयति||to make crazy}} and {{cog|la|libet}}.

